2. **Archetype Shift** - "Coach wants Giannis initiating from top" → increase AST projection
3. **Hustle & Fatigue** - "Tired legs on B2B" → reduce PPP
4. **Lineup Hints** - "Player will start" → 15-30 minute edge before official announcement

**Twitter/X Monitoring Strategy**:
- Create dedicated list with all 60+ beat writers
- Keyword triggers: "Out," "Starting," "Minutes Limit," "Available," "Limping," "Restriction," "Shootaround"
- Monitor 2-3 hours before game time
- Cross-reference with Underdog NBA feed for speed

