## 6. Advanced Stat Metrics to Integrate

### From awesome-nba-data Repository

**Impact Metrics** (for player evaluation):
- **EPM** (Estimated Plus-Minus) - [Dunks & Threes](https://dunksandthrees.com/epm)
- **LEBRON** - [BBall Index](https://www.bball-index.com/lebron-database/)
- **RAPTOR** - [FiveThirtyEight](https://fivethirtyeight.com/features/introducing-raptor-our-new-metric-for-the-modern-nba/) (archived)
- **BPM** (Box Plus/Minus) - [Basketball-Reference](https://www.basketball-reference.com/about/bpm2.html)

**Efficiency Metrics**:
- **TS%** (True Shooting %) - Accounts for FTs and 3PM value
- **eFG%** (Effective FG%) - Weights 3PM as 1.5x
- **Net Rating** - Points per 100 possessions differential

**Usage & Opportunity**:
- **USG%** (Usage Rate) - Percentage of team plays used while on court
- **PIE** (Player Impact Estimate) - Overall contribution percentage
- **Win Shares** - Estimated wins contributed

**Application Priority**:
1. **TS%** → Replace raw FG% in efficiency calculations
2. **USG%** → Core input for "Usage Vacuum" redistribution
3. **Net Rating** → Team strength baseline
4. **BPM** → Quick player value assessment

